cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this report, cite it as below."
title: "Ternary Bonsai 徹底解剖: 27B級を5.9GBで動かす1.58-bitのリバースエンジニアリング"
abstract: >-
  An independent technical report on PrismML's Ternary Bonsai 2 27B.
  Combines a literature review of ternary quantization with byte-level
  reverse engineering of the released GGUF files, the Hadamard rotation,
  the 42/128 zero-mask structure, and the runtime kernels.
authors:
  - family-names: "ELRdn"
    given-names: "ELRdn"
date-released: "2026-10-25"
license: "MIT"
url: "https://github.com/ELRdn/bonsai-ternary-REA"
keywords:
  - ternary quantization
  - 1.58-bit
  - Bonsai
  - PrismML
  - GGUF
  - llama.cpp
  - reverse engineering
